// Shared by the launcher, workflow switcher and image viewer shortcut.
export global BuildingDerivationPreset {
    out property <image> artwork: @image-url("../../assets/free-canvas/building-derivation.png");
    out property <string> prompt-zh: "建筑功能衍生：根据上传的建筑参考图，自动识别其世界观、时代、建筑语言、轮廓比例、屋顶与门窗特征、材质、主辅配色、装饰纹样、线条、渲染方式、视角、光照和细节密度，衍生出{count}座同风格、不同功能的新建筑，形成可用于同一个游戏世界的成套建筑资产。参考图仅作为风格来源，不作为额外一项重复展示。若用户指定用途，优先按给定用途及顺序设计，不足所选数量时补充同世界观下的其他合理用途；未指定时，自动选择住宅、商店、仓库、工坊、酒馆、兵营、图书馆、诊所、瞭望塔等互不重复且符合参考世界观的功能，不能强行加入不合时代的设施。若参考是草屋，延续草顶、木构与部落工艺；若是城堡，延续其屋顶、石材与阵营纹样；若是移动餐车或摊位，延续移动底盘或摊位结构，衍生不同营业用途；若是雕像、棋子或装饰造型，则提取其材质和造型母题，转化为可辨识的功能建筑。各建筑通过整体结构、屋顶组合、入口、功能设施和少量附属道具表现用途，例如铁匠铺的熔炉与铁砧、面包店的烤炉与面包、仓库的货箱与装卸口。每座建筑功能和轮廓都要有明确差异，同时保留同系列的配色、材质、工艺与视觉识别。保持原图的2D或3D表现方式和观察角度，不得强行转为等距3D。这是平级的功能扩展，不是同一建筑逐级升级、变大、换色或简单复制，不要套用稀有度等级色。输出一张成套建筑图，所有建筑和各自附属物、地基、阴影都完整、独立、互不接触，使用单一纯色背景。不得出现文字、字母、数字、编号、标签、可读招牌、箭头、原图缩略图或水印。";
    out property <string> prompt-en: "Building function derivation: automatically identify the uploaded reference's world, era, architectural language, silhouette proportions, roof and window vocabulary, materials, primary and secondary colors, motifs, linework, rendering medium, camera, lighting and detail density. Derive exactly {count} NEW buildings with different functions in the same coherent visual family, suitable for one game world. Use the reference only as a style source, not as an extra repeated item. Prioritize the user's requested functions in their supplied order; fill remaining slots with other compatible uses. If unspecified, automatically choose distinct, era-appropriate functions such as housing, shop, warehouse, workshop, tavern, barracks, library, clinic and watchtower. Preserve thatched timber tribal construction for huts, the roof, stone and faction motifs for castles, and mobile chassis or stall structures for food trucks and kiosks with varied businesses. If the source is a statue, chess piece or decorative object, translate its material and shape motifs into recognizable functional buildings. Communicate function through structure, roof combinations, entrances, functional equipment and a few attached props: forge and anvil for a smithy, oven and bread for a bakery, crates and loading doors for a warehouse. Give each building a distinct purpose and silhouette while preserving the family's palette, materials, craftsmanship and visual identity. Preserve the source's 2D or 3D medium and camera; do not force isometric 3D. These are parallel functional variants, not consecutive upgrades, enlargement, recoloring or duplicates. Do not apply rarity-tier colors. Output one building asset sheet on a single solid-color background. Keep every building, its props, foundation and shadows complete, isolated and non-touching. No words, letters, digits, numbering, labels, readable signs, arrows, reference-image insets or watermarks.";
    out property <string> hint-zh: "上传建筑图，自动衍生同风格建筑；可指定用途，例如：铁匠铺、酒馆、仓库";
    out property <string> hint-en: "Upload a building; optionally list functions, e.g. smithy, tavern, warehouse";
}
